{title: Kani Mozhiyae}
{artist: Irandaam Ulagam Karthik Harris Jayaraj}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Kanimozhi [C] ye Ennai,        [Dm] KondruPogi [G] raai
Kadai Vizhi [C] yaal Ennai,        [Dm] Thindru Pogi [G] raai
Itha [Em] yam Odai [Am] thu Ennai,        [Em] VaazhaCholgi [G] raai
Imai [Em] gal Pari [Am] thu Ennai,        [Em] ThoongaCholgi [G] raai
Oru [F] Paathi Kannil Kaathal Seigi [G] raai
Maru [F] Paathi Kannil Udal Seigi [G] raaaa,        Naan [C] Ettuthikkum Alaigiraen Nee
[G] Illai Endru Povathaa,        Adi [Am] Pattri Eriyum Kaatile Naan
[F] Pattaam Poochi [G] Aavatha,        [Am] Unthan Kannathodu
[G] Enthan Kannam Vaithaal,        [F] Naanum Mannil Konjam
[G] Vaazhnthirupen,        Adi [Am] Unthan Kanna Kuzhiyil
[G] Ennai Puthaithu Vaithaai,        [F] Mannil Maanda Pinnum
[G] Vaazhnthirupen,        Oru [C] Kalla Paarvai
[F] Paar Azhagee.... [C] .ey,        Siru [C] Kaathal Paesu
[F] Oomai Kiliyee... [C] ..ey,        Naan [C] Thedi Thiriyum
[F] Vaazhvae Neethaa [G] ne,        Thendra [Am] le Vaa Munne Mutha
[G] maa Ketki [F] ren,        Muzhuva [G] thaa Ketki [C] ren
